Preenchimento e envio do [formulário de solicitação eletrônico](https://formulario-mre.serpro.gov.br/sci/pages/web/pacomPasesWebInicial.jsf). Ao final do preenchimento, imprima o recibo de entrega e prepare a documentação para apresentar em um Posto Consular do Brasil;

*Fill and submit your [Visa application form](https://formulario-mre.serpro.gov.br/sci/pages/web/pacomPasesWebInicial.jsf). After completion, the receipt must be printed and signed by the applicant, and the original documentation must be presented at the Brazilian Consulate where your visa application will be processed;*

